{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56275","headline":"隐居（题拟） · 晓峦","name":"隐居（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杖履独游栽药圃，琴楼多在钓鱼船。\n晚来花下敲门者，不是神仙即酒仙。\n（见前书卷二五「隐逸」门。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"晓峦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56275.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56275","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}